# Deploy-only template for MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_* (SCS fork).
# Copy into the OFFICIAL deploy .env on the host — do NOT commit real URLs.
# Empty MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_URL disables the feature.
#
# MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_URL=https://YOUR-WX-SEND-HOST/wxsend
# MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_APP_URL=https://your-public-multica-origin
